  "failureAnalysis": [
    "run-1 sees old metadata after an invalid-date edit/retry; no root cause claimed from that alone.",
    "run-2 adds bounded waiting for actual dialog close; it still fails.",
    "run-3 confirms editor/current revision both 2 and records not-a-date still present after an attempted empty input; only synthetic metadata logged.",
    "run-4 focused simulated Meta+A/Backspace also fails to clear the real-IME-connected field.",
    "Flutter integration binding disables automatic TestTextInput registration, and local framework documentation warns injected text with real IME can desynchronize. This is a plausible cause, not physical-IME proof.",
    "run-5 registers the test text channel and completes native flow; post-run analysis catches missing braces in one if statement.",
    "run-6 adds braces only and repeats final-source flow; strict analysis and regressions pass."
  ],
  "remainingSpecificGate": "On an unlocked normal application, verify clearing invalid and existing expiry with real keyboard/IME, saving retry, focus and shortcuts. Registered test input does not close this gate.",
